1. INCOMPLETE FRONTEND ERROR HANDLING (FC-01 Violation - Partial): The requirement explicitly states 'The frontend needs to handle 403 Forbidden errors if this occurs.' While you modified the article.js reducer to set commentErrors when action.error is true, you have NOT modified any UI components to actually DISPLAY these errors to the user. The commentErrors state is being set but never rendered. You MUST modify either CommentList.js or CommentContainer.js to:
