3. FRONTEND ERROR HANDLING (COMPLETE): The article.js reducer now properly handles DELETE_COMMENT errors by checking action.error and setting commentErrors state with appropriate error messages. The error state is cleared on successful deletion and on ARTICLE_PAGE_LOADED.

